  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>Your skull is cleft, causing a cerebral hemorrhage as the blade sinks into the softness beneath, stopping just short of lobotomizing you.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Pass a <strong>Very Hard (-30) Endurance</strong> Test to avoid gaining the @Condition[Unconscious] Condition; otherwise gain @Condition[Prone]. If the Test was an Impressive Failure (-4 SL or more) you gain @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.M8XyRs9DN12XsFTQ]{Blood Rot} due to resulting meningitis; otherwise you gain a @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.1hQuVFZt9QnnbWzg]{Minor Infection}. Also gain @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.nbhn2wX35b7Jrcbg]{Broken Bone (Minor)} and @Condition[Fatigued] (2), the latter of which will last until the bone has set.</p>"
    },
